          <h2>OPENINGS PERFECTED.</h2>
          <h2>ETO DOORS SINCE 2005</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Why Choose -->
      <div class="eto-text-section" style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <h2 class="eto-section-title" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Why Choose ETO Doors</h2>
        <p class="eto-text-p" style="font-size: 15px;">Quality, responsible choices, and experience you can trust.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 3 Col Grid -->
      <div class="eto-about-grid">
        <div class="eto-about-col">
          <img src="{{ 'about-p-1.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="Proven Quality" class="eto-about-img">
          <h3 class="eto-about-title">PROVEN QUALITY</h3>
          <p class="eto-about-desc">More than one million doors sold to homeowners, builders, architects, and designers.</p>
          <p class="eto-col-highlight">1M+ doors sold</p>
        </div>
        <div class="eto-about-col">
          <img src="{{ 'about-p-2.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="Responsible Materials" class="eto-about-img">
          <h3 class="eto-about-title">RESPONSIBLE MATERIALS</h3>
          <p class="eto-about-desc">Thoughtfully sourced materials and energy-efficient options for better-performing spaces.</p>
          <p class="eto-col-highlight">Greener building options</p>
        </div>
        <div class="eto-about-col">
          <img src="{{ 'about-p-3.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="Experience Since 2005" class="eto-about-img">
          <h3 class="eto-about-title">EXPERIENCE SINCE 2005</h3>
          <p class="eto-about-desc">A trusted source for interior, exterior, and specialty doors for residential and commercial projects.</p>
          <p class="eto-col-highlight">Serving customers since 2005</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Text Content -->
      <div class="eto-text-section">
        <h2 class="eto-section-title">About ETO Doors</h2>
        <p class="eto-text-p">Since 2005, ETO Doors has helped homeowners, builders, architects, and designers find distinctive doors for residential and commercial spaces. With more than one million doors sold, we combine an extensive product selection with knowledgeable support to help customers choose the right door for their project, style, and budget.</p>
        <p class="eto-text-p">Our collection includes interior and exterior doors, French doors, fiberglass doors, commercial doors, sidelites, transoms, and hardware. We also offer select fire-rated, impact-rated, ENERGY STAR-certified, and FSC-approved options for projects with specific safety, performance, or sustainability requirements.</p>
        <p class="eto-text-p">Customers can explore our selection online and connect with an ETO Doors specialist for personalized assistance with product selection, sizing, and ordering. Visit our <strong>Contact</strong> page or use live chat to speak with our team.</p>
      </div>


    </div>

    <!-- Hidden Why Buy Content -->
    <div id="eto-why-buy-content" style="display: none;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 24px; color: #333; margin-bottom: 15px;">Why Buy From ETODoors.com?</h2>
      <p class="eto-text-p"><strong>You can shop with confidence at ETODoors.com, as our commitment is to provide you with the best customer service when shopping with us and offer the following:</strong></p>
      
      <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 13px; color: #555; line-height: 1.6;">
        <li>01. Proven Track Record</li>
        <li>02. Largest Selection of Doors in the Industry</li>
        <li>03. Tested and Certified Products</li>
        <li>04. Low Price Guarantee</li>
        <li>05. Sustainability and Community Support</li>
      </ul>

      <!-- Video 1 -->
      <div style="margin-bottom: 20px; background: #000; height: 315px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #fff;">
         <iframe width="100%" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/KIYk30xsNNE" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen></iframe>
      </div>

      <p class="eto-text-p"><strong>Proven Track Record (including ETO Doors reviews from real customers)</strong></p>
      <p class="eto-text-p">With over one million doors sold and over 100,000 satisfied customers, our track record speaks for itself. Since 2002, ETO Doors Corp. has been supplying high end doors to some of the largest big box distributors in the country. ETO is the primary supplier of doors to many retailers around the world. Each member of our staff undergoes rigorous training and is continuously educated about the latest product offerings.</p>
      <p class="eto-text-p" style="font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 15px;">Quality, pricing, customer service, and dependability have been the core reasons for our success.</p>

      <p class="eto-text-p"><strong>Largest Selection of Doors in the Industry</strong></p>
      <p class="eto-text-p">Today, ETO has grown to offer the largest selection of doors and hardware in the industry. With over 40,000 doors in stock, ETO has the ability to fulfill virtually any door needs for any residential or commercial project. ETO proudly offers numerous species of wood, steel, fiberglass, metal, aluminum doors and more. Don't see the model you are looking for? If you can envision it, we can make it a reality. Our on-site state-of-the-art facility allows us to turn your sketches or pictures into entry ways. Simply send us your envisioned door design, and our experts will convert it into your dream door.</p>

      <!-- Video 2 -->
      <div style="margin: 30px 0; background: #000; height: 315px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #fff;">
         <iframe width="100%" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Mk3Sq37jfzk" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen></iframe>
      </div>

      <p class="eto-text-p"><strong>Tested and Certified Products</strong></p>
      <p class="eto-text-p">Research and Development is our forte at ETO Doors Corp. Our new products are tested in labs for months to assure exceptional performance in the field. Our doors have been tested and certified for fire ratings, impact-hurricane ratings, STC acoustic ratings, energy ratings and to meet FSC standards. All of our doors comply with WDMA standards I.S. 6A. Buy with confidence knowing that the doors being purchased have been tested and certified.</p>

      <p class="eto-text-p" style="margin-top: 15px;"><strong>For more information on our certified products, please see links below:</strong></p>
      <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 13px;">
        <li><a href="#" onclick="showEtoImpact(event)" style="color: blue; text-decoration: underline;">Impact-Hurricane Rating</a></li>
        <li><a href="#" onclick="showEtoFire(event)" style="color: blue; text-decoration: underline;">Fire Ratings</a></li>
        <li><a href="#" onclick="showEtoEnergy(event)" style="color: blue; text-decoration: underline;">Energy Star Ratings</a></li>
        <li><a href="#" onclick="showEtoFSC(event)" style="color: blue; text-decoration: underline;">FSC Sustainable Wood</a></li>
        <li><a href="#" onclick="showEtoSTC(event)" style="color: blue; text-decoration: underline;">STC Acoustics Rating</a></li>
      </ul>

      <p class="eto-text-p"><strong>Low Price Guarantee</strong></p>
      <p class="eto-text-p">At ETODoors.com, we firmly believe that no company can match our prices. We work hard to make sure our prices are the lowest prices around. Our worldwide presence and the sale of thousands of doors every month allow us to provide the highest quality products at the guaranteed lowest price. When you order doors from us, you will never overpay! That's why we proudly offer you a formal best price guarantee:</p>
      <p class="eto-text-p">We will beat any posted/advertised price online for discount doors in the United States. If, within 30 days of your online purchase at ETODoors.com, you find the identical product nationally advertised on the Internet for less by one of our competitors, WE WILL BEAT THE PRICE BY AT LEAST 15%, or refund the difference. We will also match shipping prices; if we are sent a legitimate shipping quote with the same shipping options, such as residential delivery, lift gate, terminal pickup, and lead times etc., we will lower your shipping quote by 15% or refund the difference. <a href="#" onclick="showEtoPrice(event)" style="color: blue;">Learn more</a></p>

      <!-- Video 3 -->
      <div style="margin: 30px 0; background: #000; height: 315px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #fff;">
         <iframe width="100%" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/1tbcpnlD3MI" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen></iframe>
      </div>

       <p class="eto-text-p"><strong>Sustainability and Community Support</strong></p>
       <p class="eto-text-p">ETO Doors Corp. is a partner in working towards a "Green" environment. In 2009, ETO Doors became one of only a few U.S. door companies certified by the Forest Stewardship Council®, or FSC®. FSC is an independent, non-governmental, not-for-profit organization established to promote the responsible management of the world's forests. To date, ETO Doors has provided doors to numerous projects nationwide that have been "LEED" Certified (Platinum: the highest level of Green Certification attainable).</p>
       <p class="eto-text-p">ETO's contribution to the environment by going green is equivalent to saving nearly 1,500 acres of trees, resulting in a significant reduction of toxic air and climate changes. The Mayor of the City of Los Angeles has also recognized and congratulated ETO Doors for its "Green Initiatives." To read more about our green initiatives please click here. (links to <a href="#" style="color: blue;">http://www.etodoors.com/eto-green</a>)</p>
       <p class="eto-text-p">Additionally, ETO is proud to support our nation's building industry and various organizations including: The California Building Industry Association, "CBIA," The Federation of the National Association of Home Builders "NAHB" and The Door and Hardware Institute "DHI." <a href="#" onclick="showEtoAffiliations(event)" style="color: blue;">Learn more.</a></p>
       <p class="eto-text-p"><strong>We invite you to visit us in person in our 300,000 sq/ft state of the art door manufacturing facility located in Downtown Los Angeles, our New York Showroom or online at www.etodoors.com.</strong></p>

       <!-- Banner: Custom Doors Program -->
       <div style="margin: 30px 0; text-align: center;">
         <img src="{{ 'custom-door-banner.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="ETO Custom Doors Program" style="max-width: 100%;">
       </div>

