        <h2 style="font-size: 24px; color: #333; margin-bottom: 20px;">Sustainable Woods</h2>
        
        <p class="eto-text-p">ETO Doors Corp. is a partner in working towards a "Green" environment. ETO Doors Corp. is pleased to announce its new initiatives to make our company a greener environmental-friendly workplace.</p>
        <p class="eto-text-p">Please be assured that ETO Doors Corp. is committed to the protection of the Rain Forest. Strict compliance is maintained with all foreign government regulations to protect the Rain Forest. None of the timber used to produce ETO Doors is ever listed as endangered.</p>
        <p class="eto-text-p">All of our doors that are produced in South America are produced from sustainable wood products and are supplied from re-harvesting plants in South America.</p>
        <p class="eto-text-p">ETO Doors has provided doors to numerous projects nationwide that have been "LEED" Certified (Platinum: the highest level of Green Certification attainable).</p>

        <h3 style="font-size: 20px; color: #333; margin: 25px 0 15px;">Solar Panels</h3>
        
        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px; overflow: hidden;">
             <!-- Solar Panels Image - floated right -->
             <img src="{{ 'fsc-solar.jpg' | file_url }}" alt="Solar Panels on ETO Facility" style="float: right; margin: 0 0 20px 20px; max-width: 300px;">
             
             <p class="eto-text-p">As for our facility itself, ETO Doors now hosts numerous solar panels on its roof tops. Solar panels generate electricity by channeling natural sunlight. These panels are environment-friendly because they do not pollute or require the use of non-replenishable resources. Los Angeles has an average of 320 full sunny days per year, giving us the perfect climate to use our solar panels to go green.</p>
             <p class="eto-text-p">These solar panels have converted ETO to an independent energy producer for its electrical needs. ETO's contribution to the environment by going green is equivalent to saving nearly 1,500 acres of trees, resulting in a significant reduction of toxic air and climate changes.</p>
             <p class="eto-text-p">Here at ETO Doors, we are dedicated to preserving our planet. We look forward to the opportunity to continue to implement eco-friendly measures in the future.</p>
        </div>

        <h3 style="font-size: 20px; color: #333; margin: 25px 0 15px;">City of Los Angeles Mayoral Recognition</h3>
        
